Adds librw's WGPU platform (Phase 2 design, section 6.1): PLATFORM_WGPU = 13, the driver
registration and dispatch in the generic files, DXT pass-through without flipping, and the
CMake platform that compiles src/wgpu (copied from renderers/wgpu/librw/files) and links
the prebuilt rwgpu library. Applied inside vendor/librw by reVC Builder.

